# KEEPR
Track your subscriptions, avoid surprise charges, and stay in control.

# Description

KEEPR is a subscription tracking web app built as a MEN stack CRUD project.
The goal of the project was to design and build a full-stack application that allows users to log, manage, and review recurring subscriptions while maintaining a clean, user-friendly interface.

I built KEEPR to solve a real problem I personally experience: forgetting about subscriptions until after I’m charged. The app focuses on clarity, visibility, and control showing users what’s active, what’s renewing soon, and how much they’re actually spending.

